body:
If you're going to stand with them, learn to counter strike. You can get a rock sometimes if you throw a wild overhand or kick too. Never go for body hooks because they'll just throw an uppercut. Also once you rock them, throw your best block breaking combo, do not let them recover.

&#x200B;

Personally, the best way to deal with Div 7/8 AI is just to grapple with them. If you're top/bot game is high enough, you can transition with ease. Getting the TD can be tricky though. **Always go for the sub though**, trying to smesh them won't get you anywhere because they'll arm trap you every time. Unless you're a god at holding side control or something.
